  <div id="sutta">
  
    <h4 id="thig1.11" class="h1">Thig 1:11  Muttā</h4>
          <div class="verse">
            <p>So freed! So thoroughly freed am I!—</p>
            <p>from three crooked things set free:</p>
            <p class="v2">from mortar, pestle,</p>
            <p class="v2">&amp; crooked old husband.</p>
            <p>Having uprooted the craving</p>
            <p>that leads to becoming,</p>
            <p>I’m from aging &amp; death set free.</p>
          </div><!--end verse-->
          <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../Thag/thag1_43.html">Thag 1:43</a>; <a href="../Thag/thag2_9.html">Thag 2:9</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
